%% 2.1.5 Entrada no domínio com realmd e adcli
sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Ubuntu (realm / adcli)
    participant D as DNS (SR2-SRV:53)
    participant K as KDC (SR2-SRV:88)
    participant L as LDAP do AD (SR2-SRV:389)
    R->>D: realm discover - SRV _ldap / _kerberos
    D-->>R: SR2-SRV.isec.local (active-directory)
    R->>K: Autentica Administrator (Kerberos)
    K-->>R: Ticket do Administrator
    R->>L: Cria a conta de computador UBUCLIENT
    L-->>R: Conta criada
    R->>R: Gera keytab e /etc/sssd/sssd.conf, arranca o SSSD
